## STEP 5 — Connect this to your website
1. Open "Webhook" node → add a Header Auth credential (any header name, e.g. x-api-key, and a secret only you know).
2. Copy the node's Production URL.
3. From your site, POST to it:

fetch(PRODUCTION_WEBHOOK_URL, {
  method: "POST",
  headers: {
    "Content-Type": "application/json",
    "x-api-key": "YOUR_SECRET_VALUE"
  },
  body: JSON.stringify({
    name: "Visitor",
    message: userMessage,
    sessionId: sessionId // same id per conversation, e.g. crypto.randomUUID()
  })
})

4. "Respond to Webhook" sends back the AI Agent's reply as-is — reshape it there if your frontend expects a different shape.
